  "title": "Grilled Mediterranean-Inspired Citrus Chicken Thighs",
  "description": "A super simple marinade of lemon juice, garlic, and thyme brings tons of Mediterranean flavor to grilled citrus chicken thighs.",
  "authors": [
    "westcoastcook"
  ],
